# =============================================================================
# Code owners
# =============================================================================
# Whoever is listed here is requested for review automatically when a matching
# path changes. GitHub matches the LAST rule that applies, so the specific
# rules below deliberately come after the catch-all.
#
# SETUP: replace @OWNER with your GitHub username or team (e.g. @acme/platform)
#        before pushing. GitHub silently ignores rules that name an account
#        without repository access, so a stale handle here looks like it is
#        working when it is not.
# =============================================================================

# Everything, unless a more specific rule applies below.
*                           @OWNER

